    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_sub">Cotes collects nothing</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Cotes has no ads, no analytics and no accounts of its own. Without Google sign-in the app never goes online: notes are stored only in the app’s private storage on this device. If you sign in with Google, notes are also kept in a hidden app folder in your own Google Drive — only Cotes can see it, and Cotes can’t see your other Drive files. Notes never go to the developer.</string>
